    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81fdb9ebb80526e83d1e11fa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『橡树大赛』是每年5月在东京赛场举行的\n草地2400米中距离GⅠ赛事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "195574e6e5061bff15010bbb81786454247203007cc36f7471d2a39a6ec7348d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
