      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "和被称为赛马娘盛典的『日本德比』一样，\n有着历史与权威的2400米赛事。\n那份荣耀，在后冠中也尤为耀眼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6475fd1e7a220bc3d93788975ead88eeae269c0cd03d3f7708d57d8f35b05af5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
