      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且『橡树大赛』比『樱花赏』\n要晚一个月左右举行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd146d33428de38b316f5f1c7ce4ef384aeb1a0f138a11f1e36306d1566e4210",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
